msgstr "マージでの扱い:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:772
msgid "Which value should the merge keep?"
msgstr "マージでどちらの値を採りますか？"

#: includes/class-admin.php:773
msgid "Only the conflicting columns are decided here. Columns changed only on the branch are merged either way."
msgstr "ここで決めるのは、競合した列だけです。ブランチだけで変えた列は、どちらを選んでもマージされます。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:779
msgid "This row is no longer in the diff (it may have been merged or changed back)."
msgstr "この行は、もう差分にありません（マージされたか、元に戻された可能性があります）。"

#. translators: 1: parent, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:805
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s at fork (%2$s)"
msgstr "分岐の時点の %1$s（%2$s）"

#. translators: %s: parent
#. translators: %s: branch
#: includes/class-admin.php:795
#: includes/class-admin.php:808
#: includes/class-admin.php:834
#: includes/class-admin.php:846
#: includes/class-admin.php:848
#, php-format
msgid "%s now"
msgstr "今の %s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:880
msgid "HeimDB keeps every version of every row for the retention period. See what changed since a point in time, read a row as it was, restore the branch to that point (undoable), or branch off from it."
msgstr "HeimDB は、古いバージョンを残す期間のあいだ、すべての行のすべてのバージョンを持っています。ある時点からの変更を見る、行の当時の値を読む、ブランチをその時点に戻す（取り消せます）、その時点からブランチを作る、ができます。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:902
msgid "15 min ago"
msgstr "15 分前"

#: includes/class-admin.php:903
msgid "1 hour ago"
msgstr "1 時間前"

#: includes/class-admin.php:904
msgid "1 day ago"
msgstr "1 日前"

#: includes/class-admin.php:905
msgid "7 days ago"
msgstr "7 日前"

#: includes/class-admin.php:912
msgid "Time"
msgstr "時刻"

#: includes/class-admin.php:921
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表"

#: includes/class-admin.php:922
msgid "Comma separated. Empty means all."
msgstr "カンマ区切り。空ならすべて。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:925
msgid "Show changes since then"
msgstr "その時点からの変更を表示"

#: includes/class-admin.php:926
msgid "Preview restoring to then"
msgstr "その時点への復元を下見"

#. translators: 1: branch, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:935
#, php-format
msgid "Changes on %1$s since %2$s"
msgstr "%2$s からの %1$s の変更"

#: includes/class-admin.php:937
msgid "Nothing changed since then."
msgstr "その時点から変わったものはありません。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:940
msgid "Changed at"
msgstr "変更の時刻"

#: includes/class-admin.php:940
msgid "Change"
msgstr "変更"

#. translators: 1: branch, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:971
#, php-format
msgid "Restoring %1$s to %2$s would…"
msgstr "%1$s を %2$s に復元すると…"

#: includes/class-admin.php:973
msgid "Nothing to restore: the branch is already in that state."
msgstr "復元するものはありません。ブランチはすでにその状態です。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:987
msgid "Comments and users (wp_comments, wp_commentmeta, wp_users, wp_usermeta) are kept as they are now, so comments posted and users added since then are not lost. Choose \"All tables\" to restore them too."
msgstr "コメントとユーザー（wp_comments、wp_commentmeta、wp_users、wp_usermeta）は今のまま残すので、その後に付いたコメントや追加したユーザーは失われません。これらも戻すなら「すべての表」を選んでください。"

#. translators: 1: branch, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:993
#, php-format
msgid "Restore %1$s to %2$s? You can undo it afterwards."
msgstr "%1$s を %2$s の状態に復元しますか？後から取り消せます。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:996
msgid "Everything except comments and users"
msgstr "コメントとユーザー以外のすべて"

#: includes/class-admin.php:997
msgid "All tables (including comments and users)"
msgstr "すべての表（コメントとユーザーを含む）"

#: includes/class-admin.php:998
msgid "Only these tables:"
msgstr "次の表だけ:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1005
msgid "Restore"
msgstr "復元"

#. translators: %s: branch
#: includes/class-admin.php:1028
#, php-format
msgid "Branch %s"
msgstr "ブランチ %s"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1031
msgid "Now"
msgstr "今"

#. translators: 1: table, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:1038
#, php-format
msgid "To put back only this table, preview restoring %1$s to %2$s."
msgstr "この表だけを戻すなら、%1$s を %2$s に復元する下見をしてください。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1039
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "下見"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1046
msgid "Branch off from this point"
msgstr "この時点からブランチを作成"

#. translators: 1: branch, 2: time
#: includes/class-admin.php:1048
#, php-format
msgid "Creates a new branch with %1$s as it was at %2$s, without changing %1$s. Useful to look around or to take data back by merging."
msgstr "%2$s の時点の %1$s から新しいブランチを作ります。%1$s は変わりません。当時の状態を見て回るときや、データをマージで取り戻すときに使えます。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1059
msgid "HeimDB status"
msgstr "HeimDB の状態"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1079
msgid "None yet."
msgstr "まだありません。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1086
msgid "Server"
msgstr "サーバ"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1077
#: includes/class-admin.php:1097
msgid "Tables excluded from merges"
msgstr "マージから外す表"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1098
msgid "Rebuildable tables such as search indexes (e.g. wp_yoast_%). Merges leave them as they are on the parent."
msgstr "検索の索引など、作り直せる表（例: wp_yoast_%）。マージでは親の表をそのまま残します。"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1105
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "外す"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1110
msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "マージから外す"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1113
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "バックアップ"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1114
msgid "A consistent online backup of all branches, history and users, written under the server's -backup-dir."
